WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0005: BG3's effects replayed inside WoW with BG3's own shaders (on top of
0001-0004). Capture format: link/benilla/fx-replay-format.md.

- wowbg3_fx.rs: decodes fxframe.bin and loads the recipes, SPIR-V, samplers and textures it
  names; keeps the last 8 frames and replays the one BG3 drew with the camera record the world
  camera follows (FXQ1 bg3cam_seq), none while it does not follow BG3's; takes the TAA jitter
  out of the per-view block (set 0 binding 2).
- wowbg3_fx_render.rs: replays the draws through wgpu's SPIR-V passthrough over black and over
  white, then composites them into the world camera's view through BG3's post chain. Special
  keys: 1 WoW's depth, 2 WoW's colour, 3 (fog volume) empty, 4 WoW's view z / far, 5 (light
  grid) one constant light (WOW_BG3_FX_LIGHT, default 32 = 1 after BG3's 1/32).
- wowbg3_lead.rs: camera_seq() (the bg3cam.bin record followed this frame) and a debug knob,
  WOW_BG3_LEAD_ZOOM (narrows WoW's field of view for close looks; the composite is off then).
- lib.rs, wowbg3.rs: module and plugin registration.

